flowchart TD
    Start([Will abre betboom.com]) --> Login{Logado?}
    Login -->|Nao| DoLogin[Faz login] --> Login
    Login -->|Sim| BacBo[Clica em Bac Bo Live]

    BacBo --> Inject[manifest.json injeta 3 scripts]
    Inject --> Main[injected.js MAIN world override WebSocket]
    Inject --> Iso[content.js ISOLATED world]
    Inject --> Cali[calibrator-main.js API console]

    Main -.postMessage.-> Iso

    OpenExt[Will abre popup da extensao] --> PopupUI[popup.js mostra saldo + estrategia]
    PopupUI --> Overlay[overlay.js renderiza tabuleiro 6x26]

    Iso --> WaitWS{Frame WS chegou?}
    WaitWS -->|Nao| WaitWS
    WaitWS -->|Sim| Parse[content.js parseia frame]

    Parse --> Collect[collector.js atualiza FIFO 6x26 + signature]

    Collect --> SigCheck{Signature ja vista?}
    SigCheck -->|Sim| Skip[Ignora - idempotencia]
    SigCheck -->|Nao| Pipeline[robo-runtime.js 7 checkpoints]

    Pipeline --> CP1{1.VALIDATE_HISTORY FIFO integro?}
    CP1 -->|Nao| Abort[Aborta rodada]
    CP1 -->|Sim| CP2[2.TELEMETRY log contexto]

    CP2 --> CP3{3.PATTERN faixa 50-60% ou 70-78%?}
    CP3 -->|Fora| Wait[Aguarda proxima rodada]
    CP3 -->|Dentro| CP4{4.CONTEXT banca/stack/gale OK?}

    CP4 -->|Nao| Abort
    CP4 -->|Sim| CP5[5.CONSENSUS engines votam]

    CP5 --> CP6{6.CONVICTION empate?}
    CP6 -->|Sim| Blue[Forca AZUL]
    CP6 -->|Nao| Invert[Inverte azul-vermelho na faixa]
    Blue --> CP7
    Invert --> CP7

    CP7{7.SAFETY cap R$5K?}
    CP7 -->|Acima| Abort
    CP7 -->|OK| Decision[/action: BET color: AZUL amount: R$100/]

    Decision --> Exec[executor.js]
    Exec --> Delay[Delay 300-800ms anti-bot]
    Delay --> Chip[Seleciona ficha R$100]
    Chip --> Click[Click sintetico y=78%]

    Click --> Confirm{bet-confirmation tracker DOM e saldo OK em 10s?}
    Confirm -->|Nao| Retry[Retry / log falha]
    Confirm -->|Sim| Armed[Aposta armada]

    Armed --> DealerWS{WS resultado chegou?}
    DealerWS -->|Nao| DealerWS
    DealerWS -->|Sim| Result{Resultado = AZUL?}

    Result -->|Sim| Win[VITORIA]
    Result -->|Nao| Loss[Derrota]

    Win --> Toast[overlay.js toast verde +R$200 lucro]
    Win --> UpdateBoard[Tabuleiro nova linha azul]
    Win --> Sync[popup atualiza saldo]
    Win --> Trigger[Mensagem de incentivo - A IMPLEMENTAR?]

    Loss --> Gale{Gale ativo?}
    Gale -->|Sim| NextRound[Proxima rodada com stake dobrado]
    Gale -->|Nao| WaitWS

    Toast --> WaitWS
    Sync --> WaitWS

